        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>11.1 与三角形有关的线段</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #eeeeeb;\n      color: #656565;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 764px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 58px 43px 30px;\n      background: #fafaf8;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .chapter-title {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      color: #444;\n      margin: 0 0 26px 3px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    .watermark {\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #222;\n      font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n      transform: translateX(13px);\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      color: #555;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: .5px;\n      margin: 0 0 10px 31px;\n    }\n    .intro {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 20px;\n      letter-spacing: .15px;\n    }\n    .intro p { margin: 0; }\n    .top-area {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 125px;\n      column-gap: 8px;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n    .tri-one {\n      margin-top: 11px;\n      width: 125px;\n      height: 113px;\n      position: relative;\n      color: #666;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    svg text {\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n      fill: #696969;\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .caption {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-style: normal;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #777;\n    }\n    .continuation {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 20px;\n      margin-top: -5px;\n      letter-spacing: .1px;\n    }\n    .continuation p { margin: 0; }\n    .triangle-row {\n      width: 335px;\n      margin: 8px auto 0;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n    .small-triangle {\n      width: 95px;\n      height: 78px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .small-triangle svg {\n      display: block;\n      width: 95px;\n      height: 62px;\n    }\n    .small-triangle .caption {\n      margin-top: -1px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n    .fig-caption {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      margin-top: -1px;\n      color: #777;\n    }\n    .thinking {\n      margin: 14px 0 0 0;\n      background: #edf4f5;\n      min-height: 103px;\n      padding: 10px 13px 9px 15px;\n      color: #777;\n    }\n    .thinking-head {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      height: 23px;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      color: #555;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .thinking-icon {\n      width: 27px;\n      height: 27px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #45a7ce;\n      color: white;\n      margin-right: 9px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .thinking p {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 20px;\n      margin: 3px 0 0 30px;\n      letter-spacing: .15px;\n    }\n    .question {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 21px;\n      margin: 16px 0 0 30px;\n      text-indent: 0;\n      letter-spacing: .2px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 44px;\n      bottom: 33px;\n      color: #858585;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n    .footer .page-no {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-right: 18px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <h1 class=\"chapter-title\">11.1　与三角形有关的线段</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\">@🌚港城宝藏女孩😊</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">11.1.1　三角形的边</div>\n\n    <div class=\"top-area\">\n      <div class=\"intro\">\n        <p>在本章引言中，我们提到好多三角形的实际例子，<br>由不在同一条直线上的三条线段首尾顺次相<br>接所组成的图形叫做三角形（triangle）。</p>\n        <p>在图11.1-1中，线段 $AB$、$BC$、$CA$ 是三角<br>形的边。点 $A$、$B$、$C$ 是三角形的顶点。$\\angle A$、<br>$\\angle B$、$\\angle C$ 是相邻两边组成的角，叫做三角形的内<br>角，或简称三角形的角。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder tri-one\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 125 91\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: triangle ABC with sides a b c]\">\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"79\" y2=\"9\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"79\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"113\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"113\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <text x=\"75\" y=\"7\" font-size=\"10\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"4\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"10\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"115\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"10\">C</text>\n          <text x=\"62\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"10\">a</text>\n          <text x=\"96\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"10\">b</text>\n          <text x=\"39\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"10\">c</text>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"caption\">图 11.1-1</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"continuation\">\n      <p>顶点是 $A$，$B$，$C$ 的三角形，记作$\\triangle ABC$，读作“三角形 $ABC$”。</p>\n      <p>$\\triangle ABC$ 的三边，有时也用 $a$，$b$，$c$ 来表示，如图11.1-1，顶点 $A$ 所对的边 $BC$<br>用 $a$ 表示，顶点 $B$ 所对的边 $CA$ 用 $b$ 表示，顶点 $C$ 所对的边 $AB$ 用 $c$ 表示。</p>\n      <p>我们知道：三边都相等的三角形叫做等边三角形（图11.1-2（1））；有<br>两边相等的三角形叫做等腰三角形（图11.1-2（2））。</p>\n      <p>图11.1-2（3）中的三角形是三边都不相等的三角形。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"triangle-row\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder small-triangle\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 95 62\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: equilateral triangle]\">\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"46\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"46\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <text x=\"43\" y=\"5\" font-size=\"9\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"4\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"9\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"84\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"9\">C</text>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"caption\">（1）</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder small-triangle\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 95 62\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: isosceles triangle]\">\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"15\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"47\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"83\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"83\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <text x=\"44\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"9\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"4\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"9\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"85\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"9\">C</text>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"caption\">（2）</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder small-triangle\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 95 62\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: scalene triangle]\">\n          <line x1=\"11\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"12\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"47\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"11\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <text x=\"44\" y=\"10\" font-size=\"9\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"3\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"9\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"84\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"9\">C</text>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"caption\">（3）</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fig-caption\">图 11.1-2</div>\n\n    <div class=\"thinking\">\n      <div class=\"thinking-head\">\n        <div class=\"thinking-icon\">✦</div>\n        <span>思考</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>我们知道，按照三个内角的大小，可以将三角形分为锐角三角形、直<br>角三角形和钝角三角形。如何按照边的关系对三角形进行分类呢？说说你<br>的想法，并与同学交流。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">以“是否有边相等”，可以将三角形分为两类：三边都不相等的三角形和<br>等腰三角形。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\"><span class=\"page-no\">2</span>第十一章　三角形</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
